      "material": true,
      "rationale": "The current policy, caller, receipt schema, updater, emitter, and focused lifecycle tests bind the local update and content-free receipt behavior. The SKILL documents the external consumer handoff, but this repository does not execute or verify destination derivation, contribution preview, or public-consent enforcement; exact owner acceptance authorizes none of those external states.",
